        <owl:annotatedTarget>The outermost and densest membrane of the three mammalian meninges covering the brain and spinal cord. [Elsevier&apos;s_encyclopaedic_dictionary_of_medicine, Part_B:_Anatomy_(1988)_Amsterdam_etc.:_Elsevier, adapted_from_Dorian_AF][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
