        <owl:annotatedTarget>Only ZFA considers this part_of immune system - we weaken this to an overlaps relation, as in general it&apos;s only a subset of cells that have clear immune function.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:external_ontology>ZFA</oboInOwl:external_ontology>
    </owl:Axiom>
