            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Embryonic ectoderm that gives rise to nervous tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000233>https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3682</obo:IAO_0000233>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>(...) the ability of ectoderm to produce neuronal cells is a general metazoan feature.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000007>neurectodermal</obo:UBPROP_0000007>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000013>we prefer neuroectoderm to neural ectoderm since placodal ectoderm is not classified here</obo:UBPROP_0000013>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>AAO:0011074</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
