        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>cartilage tissue</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>cartilaginous tissue</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>chondrogenic tissue</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
