        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>ventral and anterior tegmental nucleus are synonyms in FMA, but we split these into seperate classes. This is consistent with MA, ABA and neuronames, which treat these as distinct (NN suggest the anterior is a rodent specific structure)</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000015>this is part of pons and brainstem in MA, but this leads to an inconsistency with ABA. We err on the side of safety, and exclude the relationship to the pons here.</obo:UBPROP_0000015>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>VTg</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
