    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002673 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002673">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007245"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0019263"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="genid10971"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="genid10973"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Nuclear complex containing the vestibular nuclei.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>In TA they are grouped in both the pons and medulla; DHBA has &apos;vestibular nuclei of pons&apos;, with LVN and SVN underneath; WP+MA says the SVN is in the pons, and GO includes VNC development under pons development, but this is not supported by ABA. Todo - check with NIF.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:RO_0002171 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001719"/>
