        <obo:IAO_0000115>The part of the brain that is the morphological boundary between the midbrain and hindbrain and that is the location of an organizing center which patterns the midbrain and hindbrain primordia of the neural plate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>consider adding class for organizer. Consider adding separate class for isthmus as a structure</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>Lampreys also have an MHB [midbrain hindbrain boundary], expressing a similar repertoire of regulatory gene cognates as in gnathostomes.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
