        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>pia mater of neuraxis of hindbrain</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>rhombencephalon pia mater</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
