            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A structure created during embryogenesis when the lateral mesoderm splits into two layers - the inner (or splanchnic) layer adheres to the endoderm, and with it forms the splanchnopleure[WP].</obo:IAO_0000115>
