        <obo:IAO_0000115>Anatomical structure embedded in or located in the integument that is part of the integumental system. Examples: hair, follicles, skin glands, claws, nails, feathers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>add subclasses based on resolution of CARO tracker item. Also check: adnexal gland. Note that MP implicitly includes hypodermis.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>the tissue or structures associated with or embedded in the skin such as hair and hair follicles, sweat glands, sebaceous glands and claws or nails[MP:0010678]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:37883</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Skin_appendage</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>body hair or bristle</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>adnexae cutis</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
