        <obo:IAO_0000115>The structure from the trachea, bronchi, and bronchioles that forms the airways that supply air to the lungs. The lining of the tracheobronchial tree consists of ciliated columnar epithelial cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>UBERON:0004102</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:7393</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
