        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any muscle organ that is part of a pectoral girdle region.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>EMAPA has both non-skeletal and skeletal types, with the non-skeletal also including a chest muscle, so we place the skeletal class here as the most accurate</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
