        <obo:IAO_0000115>A narrow stripe of cells that lies between the prospective dorsal and ventral thalami. This boundary contains signals that pattern the prethalamic and thalamic territories of the future mid-diencephalon.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Modeling this as a line may not be correct - see http://code.google.com/p/caro2/issues/detail?id=17</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>The border between the dorsal and ventral thalamus.[TAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
